{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b99d8eae6f242db2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Dashboard run comparison view (side-by-side and diff)\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 0\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 6\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Dashboard run comparison view (side-by-side and diff)\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tDelivers a comparison surface in the Dashboard where users select two or more\n34\ttraining or pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side,\n35\tincluding a diff presentation that highlights which parameters and metrics\n36\tchanged between two selected runs. This replaces the current workflow in which\n37\tcomparison happens only in exported spreadsheets because parameters and\n38\tmetrics are confined to per-run pages.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Multi-selection of two or more runs from the existing runs list, covering\n43\t  both training runs and pipeline runs.\n44\t- A comparison view presenting each selected run's parameters and metrics side\n45\t  by side.\n46\t- A diff presentation over the same comparison data that highlights which\n47\t  parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs (a presentation\n48\t  mode of the comparison surface, not a separate view family).\n49\t- Read-only comparison; data sourced from the same per-run parameters and\n50\t  metrics the existing run detail pages show.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- Given the runs list, when the user selects two or more runs and opens the\n55\t  comparison, then each selected run's parameters and metrics are displayed\n56\t  side by side in the Dashboard.\n57\t- Given two selected runs in the comparison, when the diff presentation is\n58\t  chosen, then the parameters and metrics that differ between the two runs are\n59\t  highlighted.\n60\t- The comparison works for pipeline runs using the run data already surfaced\n61\t  by the platform's pipeline capabilities, and for training runs.\n62\t- Given fewer than two selected runs, the comparison action is unavailable or\n63\t  prompts for more selections.\n64\t- No regression to the existing per-run detail pages.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-1 (P0): select two or more runs and view parameters and metrics side by\n69\t  side in the Dashboard — primary scope of this epic.\n70\t- HLR-3 (P1): run diff view highlighting changed parameters and metrics —\n71\t  bundled here as a presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the\n72\t  same run data; covered at the higher of the two priorities (P0). The\n73\t  strategy notes the two requirements' wording overlaps because they were\n74\t  consolidated from two customer councils; they are one capability.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6415e67f3853900","agent_id":"ad84a58bf9f85a538","session_id":"44d00f4c-d13b-4638-bc59-4a21076b9c90","uuid":"a0452bd5-8434-4bcd-be6b-7fbd6b3f0baa","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:50:08.152Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b99d8eae6f242db2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
